<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 22/23.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS MAY 22/23.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for May</p>
<p>22/23. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    May 22/23	 May 21/22</p>
<p> CZK	0.43806	    0.44497</p>
<p> DKK	2.10052	    2.10052</p>
<p> FIM	2.65038	    2.6535</p>
<p> HUF	0.07475	    0.07485</p>
<p> JPY	0.11708	    0.11849</p>
<p> LTL	3.38955	    3.3779</p>
<p> LVL     23.86975	   23.86998</p>
<p> RUR	0.00236	    0.00235</p>
<p> SEK	1.78855	    1.79836</p>
<p> UAH	7.31478	    7.28192</p>
<p> USD     13.5616	    13.5116</p>
<p> XEU     15.61686	   15.62549</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>--Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
